      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:AGu">AGu</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Ælfredes laga cyninges.] [Ld] Ðis is ðæt frið, ðæt Ælfred cyninc ⁊ Gyðrum cyning ⁊ ealles Angelcynnes witan ⁊ eal seo ðeod ðe on Eastænglum beoð ealle gecweden habbað ⁊ mid aðum gefeostnod for hy selfe ⁊ heora gingran, ge for geborene ge for ungeborene, ðe Godes miltse reccen oððe ure.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">These are the terms of peace which King Alfred and King Guthrum and the councillors of all the English nation, and all the people who dwell in East Anglia, have all agreed upon and confirmed with oaths, on their own behalf and for their subjects, both living and unborn, who are anxious for God's favour and ours.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðis is þæt frið, ðæt Ælfred cyng ⁊ Guðrum cing ⁊ ealles Angelcynnes witan ⁊ eal seo ðeod ðe on Eastenglum beoð, ⁊ gesworen habbað, ge for hy selfe ge for heora ofspryng.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
